WEBVTT

00:00:05.065 --> 00:00:06.240
[SIGHS]

00:00:06.284 --> 00:00:07.851
What does it matter?

00:00:07.894 --> 00:00:10.331
It's not like
he even knows I'm alive.

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:12.812
Bridget, I can help you!

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:13.900
What if there was a way

00:00:13.944 --> 00:00:15.902
we could both get
what we want?

00:00:15.946 --> 00:00:17.687
You love Gristle, too?

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.733
You'd better back off,
girlfriend!

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:22.039
[HISSING]

00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:25.216
No. Bridget, no.

00:00:25.259 --> 00:00:29.220
That Troll King Gristle
put in his mouth,
that's Creek.

00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:32.223
And I would do anything
to save him.

00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:33.572
The only problem is...

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.052
we can't get anywhere
near the king

00:00:35.095 --> 00:00:36.357
without him eating us.

00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:37.533
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:00:40.231 --> 00:00:41.711
Oh.But...

00:00:41.754 --> 00:00:43.582
you can.

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.629
You can walk right up to him
and tell him how you feel.

00:00:47.325 --> 00:00:48.544
As if.

00:00:48.587 --> 00:00:50.720
I can't just walk right up
to the king.

00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:52.286
His Royal Awesomeness
would never talk

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.246
to a scullery maid like me.

00:00:55.289 --> 00:00:57.727
What if he didn't know
you were a scullery maid?

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.686
What if he thought
you were this total babe?

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.253
What kind of total babe

00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:04.429
would be dressed
like a scullery maid?

00:01:04.472 --> 00:01:05.691
I smell like gravy.

00:01:05.735 --> 00:01:07.258
What if we made you
a new outfit?

00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:08.433
I'm thinking...

00:01:08.476 --> 00:01:09.608
Jumpsuit!

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.262
What's the point
of a jumping suit

00:01:11.305 --> 00:01:12.698
if I still have this hair?

00:01:12.742 --> 00:01:14.091
POPPY: Oh, we can fix that.

00:01:14.134 --> 00:01:16.484
What's the point of
a new outfit and new hair...

00:01:16.528 --> 00:01:19.226
if I don't even know
what a total babe
would ever say?

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:20.663
POPPY: We can help
with that too!

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:21.751
Really?

00:01:21.794 --> 00:01:23.056
What do you say, Bridget?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.492
You get us Creek,

00:01:24.536 --> 00:01:26.625
and we'll get you
a date with the king.

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:31.978
Let's do it?

00:01:32.022 --> 00:01:33.719
A 5, 6, 7, 8...

00:01:33.763 --> 00:01:35.068
ALL:
♪ When you look in the mirror

00:01:35.112 --> 00:01:36.461
♪ Let it disappear

00:01:36.504 --> 00:01:38.724
♪ All your insecurities

00:01:38.768 --> 00:01:39.943
Wait!

00:01:39.986 --> 00:01:41.771
Why isn't
this one singing?

00:01:41.814 --> 00:01:43.076
COOPER: Come on, Branch.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.338
Sing with us!

00:01:44.382 --> 00:01:46.471
ALL: Yeah, Branch,
sing with us!

00:01:46.514 --> 00:01:47.646
Oh, no. That's okay.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:49.474
You don't think
this will work?

00:01:49.517 --> 00:01:51.650
Oh, no, no. It's not that.
I just don't sing.

00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:53.304
Branch!No.

00:01:53.347 --> 00:01:55.741
He's right.
This idea is stupid.

00:01:55.785 --> 00:01:58.526
[CRYING] King Gristle
will never love me.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.572
COOPER: Come on. Hey, hey.
What's all this?

00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:04.141
That's right, Bridget.
Just let it all out.

00:02:04.184 --> 00:02:06.665
Bridget, let it go.
Just have a good cry.

00:02:06.709 --> 00:02:07.753
Go, girl!

00:02:07.797 --> 00:02:09.494
[WAILING]

00:02:09.537 --> 00:02:11.539
Okay, now bring it back in.

00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:12.671
Reel it in.

00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:14.020
[SCOFFS]

00:02:14.064 --> 00:02:15.674
Branch,
what are you doing?

00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:17.023
You have to sing!

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:18.372
I told you, I don't sing.

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:20.548
Well, you have to!I'm sorry. I can't.

00:02:20.592 --> 00:02:22.550
No, you can.
You just won't.Fine. I just won't.

00:02:22.594 --> 00:02:23.682
You have to!No!

00:02:23.726 --> 00:02:24.683
Yes!No!

00:02:24.727 --> 00:02:26.337
Why not?
Why won't you sing?

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.208
Because singing
killed my grandma, okay?

00:02:29.862 --> 00:02:31.821
Now, leave me alone.

00:02:34.867 --> 00:02:37.914
My uncle broke his neck
tap dancing once.

00:02:42.353 --> 00:02:45.573
How did singing
kill your grandma?

00:02:47.053 --> 00:02:48.533
What song was she singing?

00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:51.231
I was the one singing.

00:02:53.233 --> 00:02:56.846
♪ And I need you now tonight

00:02:56.889 --> 00:03:00.327
♪ And I need you
more than ever

00:03:00.371 --> 00:03:04.027
BRANCH: That day,
I was so lost in song...

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.203
I didn't hear my grandma
trying to warn me.

00:03:06.246 --> 00:03:07.857
Branch! Watch out!

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:11.382
♪ And we'll only be
making it right

00:03:11.425 --> 00:03:13.253
Watch out, Branch!

00:03:13.906 --> 00:03:14.907
[BERGEN SNARLING]

00:03:15.908 --> 00:03:16.909
[SCREAMING]

00:03:20.652 --> 00:03:22.088
[GRANDMOTHER SHRIEKING]

00:03:22.132 --> 00:03:24.090
Grandma!

00:03:33.404 --> 00:03:34.884
ALL:
♪ Once upon a time

00:03:34.927 --> 00:03:36.886
♪ There was light in his life

00:03:36.929 --> 00:03:40.541
♪ But now there's
only love in the dark

00:03:40.585 --> 00:03:42.848
♪ Nothing he can say

00:03:42.892 --> 00:03:47.897
♪ A total
eclipse of the heart ♪

00:03:51.074 --> 00:03:53.946
I haven't sung a note since.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:58.081
I'm so sorry, Branch.
I had no idea.

00:03:58.124 --> 00:04:01.084
I just assumed
you had a terrible voice.

00:04:01.127 --> 00:04:05.305
No, no,
it was like an angel's.

00:04:05.349 --> 00:04:08.178
At least, that's what
Grandma used to say.

00:04:13.661 --> 00:04:14.793
Whoa, whoa.

00:04:14.837 --> 00:04:16.795
What are you doing?
It's not hug time.

00:04:16.839 --> 00:04:19.319
I just thought
you could use one.

00:04:22.192 --> 00:04:23.454
ALL: Oh...

00:04:25.804 --> 00:04:27.240
Mmm.

00:04:27.284 --> 00:04:29.808
Okay. Okay, I'll help.

00:04:29.852 --> 00:04:32.506
But I'm still not singing.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:35.814
Okay, people.
Hair we go!

00:04:35.858 --> 00:04:40.819
ALL: ♪ You

00:04:42.299 --> 00:04:46.216
♪ You gotta let it show

00:04:47.652 --> 00:04:48.696
[GASPING]

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.133
♪ I'm comin' ♪ Yay!

00:04:50.176 --> 00:04:53.136
♪ I'm comin'

00:04:53.179 --> 00:04:55.007
♪ All right ♪ Out

00:04:57.183 --> 00:04:58.837
♪ I'm comin'

00:04:58.881 --> 00:05:01.840
♪ I'm comin'

00:05:02.841 --> 00:05:04.016
♪ Out

00:05:05.626 --> 00:05:07.193
♪ I'm comin'

00:05:07.237 --> 00:05:09.326
♪ Yo! I'm coming out
like the sun after rain

00:05:09.369 --> 00:05:10.718
♪ Ready to shine

00:05:10.762 --> 00:05:12.111
♪ No time to be playin'
Feelin' good

00:05:12.155 --> 00:05:13.330
♪ Gonna get get
what I, what I want

00:05:13.373 --> 00:05:14.722
♪ Gonna show every-everybody

00:05:14.766 --> 00:05:16.246
♪ How I, how I flaunt

00:05:16.289 --> 00:05:18.335
♪ Look at me now,
my confidence is soaring

00:05:18.378 --> 00:05:20.163
♪ Dudes be impressed with
the points I'm scoring like

00:05:20.206 --> 00:05:21.947
♪ That ain't boring

00:05:21.991 --> 00:05:23.296
♪ And it just don't quit
Watch the king drop his jaw

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.471
♪ When I'm shaking my hips
I'm saying

00:05:24.515 --> 00:05:25.733
♪ She's coming out

00:05:25.777 --> 00:05:27.126
♪ She's comin'

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.867
♪ It's time to take a stand ♪ Hey!

00:05:28.911 --> 00:05:31.348
♪ And show the world
that I'm comin' out

00:05:31.391 --> 00:05:33.829
♪ She's comin' out

00:05:36.222 --> 00:05:37.223
[GROWLING]

00:05:38.572 --> 00:05:40.792
KING GRISTLE:
No, no, no! It's all wrong!

00:05:40.836 --> 00:05:42.794
I'm the king who's
bringing back Trollstice.

00:05:42.838 --> 00:05:44.404
I need a bib to match.

00:05:44.448 --> 00:05:45.492
TAILOR: Yes, sire.[GASPS]

00:05:45.536 --> 00:05:46.537
I look like a child
in this one.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.755
Oh, sire!

00:05:47.799 --> 00:05:49.366
I need something elegant,
sophisticated.

00:05:49.409 --> 00:05:51.716
You know, a man's bib.

00:05:51.759 --> 00:05:53.631
Oh, he's so beautiful.

00:05:53.674 --> 00:05:55.763
And so are you.

00:05:55.807 --> 00:05:56.895
Oh, he'll know
that I'm just a scullery maid.

00:05:56.939 --> 00:05:58.070
No, no, no!

00:05:58.114 --> 00:05:59.637
I got to get out of here.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.814
I'll be right here for you,
Bridget. We all will.

00:06:02.858 --> 00:06:04.207
You'll tell me
what to say, right?

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.556
Of course, I will.

00:06:05.599 --> 00:06:07.036
Of course, I will.

00:06:07.079 --> 00:06:09.212
Just wait until
we get inside.

00:06:09.255 --> 00:06:11.736
Ooh, Sire! I believe
I have the perfect bib!

00:06:11.779 --> 00:06:14.565
It better be!
Trollstice is tomorrow night.

00:06:14.608 --> 00:06:17.263
I mean, I look good.
But I have to look great.

00:06:17.307 --> 00:06:18.395
Right.

00:06:19.613 --> 00:06:22.355
[GASPS]
It's got a wing-dingle on it!

00:06:22.399 --> 00:06:25.010
Oh, Your Majesty! Look at you!
Such a big, big boy.

00:06:25.054 --> 00:06:27.056
I love it!

00:06:27.099 --> 00:06:29.406
BRIDGET: I think you look fat.

00:06:29.449 --> 00:06:31.756
What?

00:06:31.799 --> 00:06:34.063
P-H, phat.
Then strike that pose.

00:06:34.106 --> 00:06:35.760
P-h, Phat!

00:06:35.803 --> 00:06:36.935
Ew...

00:06:37.457 --> 00:06:39.459
Hot lunch!

00:06:39.503 --> 00:06:42.810
Total honesty
from a total babe.

00:06:42.854 --> 00:06:44.551
[CHUCKLING NERVOUSLY]

00:06:44.595 --> 00:06:46.553
And who might you be?

00:06:46.597 --> 00:06:47.815
Uh...

00:06:47.859 --> 00:06:49.078
Your name is, um...

00:06:49.817 --> 00:06:50.949
Lady!Glitter?

00:06:50.993 --> 00:06:52.603
Sparkles!Seriously?

00:06:52.646 --> 00:06:53.778
My name is

00:06:53.821 --> 00:06:56.215
Lady Glittersparkles,
seriously.

00:06:56.259 --> 00:06:59.218
Well, my lady Glittersparkles.
[CHUCKLES]

00:06:59.262 --> 00:07:01.307
Would you care to join me
for an evening...

00:07:01.351 --> 00:07:03.962
at Captain Starfunkle's
Roller Rink and Arcade?

00:07:04.006 --> 00:07:05.442
Would I!

00:07:05.485 --> 00:07:06.486
Would I?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.271
Yes! You'd be delighted.

00:07:08.314 --> 00:07:10.403
Yes! You'd be delighted.

00:07:10.447 --> 00:07:12.623
Oh, indeed,
I would.

00:07:12.666 --> 00:07:14.625
When are you gonna
ask him about Creek?

00:07:14.668 --> 00:07:15.974
We have to warm him up first.

00:07:16.018 --> 00:07:17.628
Don't you know
anything about romance?

00:07:17.671 --> 00:07:19.717
Of course!
I'm passionate about it.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.892
Really?

00:07:20.936 --> 00:07:22.633
Don't you know
anything about sarcasm?

00:07:22.676 --> 00:07:24.983
I think I had
a sarcasm once.

00:07:25.027 --> 00:07:27.246
And I'll take
one of everything, Bibbly.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.206
Things are gonna
get messy.[BELLS JINGLING]

00:07:31.903 --> 00:07:35.037
Enjoy your pizza.
Here's your tokens.

00:07:37.909 --> 00:07:40.129
Ooh, so fancy.
[FLIRTATIOUS CHUCKLE]

00:07:40.172 --> 00:07:42.870
Good thing
I brought my appetite.

